  "notes": [
    "Base King of Tokyo only, matching the existing pack name; do not mix Origins, Dark Edition, Monster Box expansion content or Power Up.",
    "Player dashboards are schematic spaces for monster identity, VP/Life dial values, energy, statuses and attached KEEP cards.",
    "The public card market always starts with 3 face-up cards; the draw/discard piles are shown separately.",
    "At 2–4 players Tokyo Bay is not used; at 5–6 both spaces are active.",
    "The two green dice are conditional card-effect dice, not part of the standard opening six-die roll."
  ],
